{"sha": "81391ea0a62f42ec12897df985d045317ee051e6c15ca752e060d03a55907900", "body": ["\\chapter{含字母的计算与方程}\\label{ch:g8:equations}", "", "七年级已经引入了字母，并化简了简单的代数式", "（见\\cref{ch:g7:literal}）。本章增加两项使代数变得强大的技能：", "\\emph{展开}括号的乘积，以及", "\\emph{解方程}，即求出隐藏在", "字母背后的那个数。", "", "\\section{展开}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[单分配律与双分配律]\\label{thm:g8:equations:expand}", "对所有数，有：", "\\[", "k(a + b) = ka + kb,", "\\qquad", "(a + b)(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "第一条法则即\\cref{thm:g7:priorities:distributivity}，", "其中符号也要考虑：$k$ 与各项可能为负（见", "\\cref{ch:g8:negprod}）。对于第二条，两次应用第一条法则，", "并把 $(c + d)$ 看作一个数：", "\\[", "(a + b)(c + d) = a(c + d) + b(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd .", "\\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:equations:expand}", "注意每一项的符号：", "\\begin{align*}", "3(2x - 5) &= 6x - 15, \\\\", "-2(4x - 7) &= -8x + 14", "&& \\text{(前面的负号使两项的符号都改变)}, \\\\", "(x + 3)(x + 5) &= x^2 + 5x + 3x + 15 = x^2 + 8x + 15, \\\\", "(2x - 1)(x - 4) &= 2x^2 - 8x - x + 4 = 2x^2 - 9x + 4 .", "\\end{align*}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.72]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (5.4,3.0);", "  \\draw[thick] (3.6,0) -- (3.6,3.0);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.9) -- (5.4,1.9);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.8,2.45) {$ac$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (4.5,2.45) {$bc$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.8,0.95) {$ad$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (4.5,0.95) {$bd$};", "  \\node[above, font=\\small] at (1.8,3.0) {$a$};", "  \\node[above, font=\\small] at (4.5,3.0) {$b$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,2.45) {$c$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,0.95) {$d$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 从面积看双重分配律：长方形", "$(a+b) \\times (c+d)$ 被分成四个较小的长方形，", "每个小长方形对应展开式中的一项。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[展开并化简]\\label{met:g8:equations:reduce}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 展开每一个乘积，并写出每一项的符号；", "  \\item 合并同类项（$x^2$ 与 $x^2$，$x$ 与 $x$，", "        数与数）；", "  \\item 用数值检验：例如在原式与化简结果中代入 $x = 2$，", "        若两者结果相等，大多数错误便能被发现。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{解方程}", "", "\\begin{definition}[方程]\\label{def:g8:equations:def}", "含未知数的等式称为\\emph{方程}\\index{方程}，", "未知数记为 $x$（或任意字母）。\\emph{求解}方程是指求出", "使等式成立的所有 $x$ 的值，", "这些值即方程的\\emph{解}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[等式的平衡法则]\\label{thm:g8:equations:balance}", "方程在下列情形下，解完全不变：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 等式两边同时加上（或减去）同一个数；", "  \\item 等式两边同时乘以（或除以）同一个", "        \\emph{非零}的数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (0,0.5);", "  \\draw[thick] (-2.6,0.5) -- (2.6,0.5);", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.5,0) -- (0.5,0);", "  \\draw[thick] (-2.2,0.5) -- (-2.2,0.75);", "  \\draw[thick] (2.2,0.5) -- (2.2,0.75);", "  \\draw[omDef, fill=omDef!15] (-2.8,0.75) rectangle (-1.6,1.45);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (-2.2,1.1) {$x{+}3$};", "  \\draw[omThm, fill=omThm!15] (1.75,0.75) rectangle (2.65,1.45);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (2.2,1.1) {$8$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.25)", "    {从两盘各拿走 $3$：$x = 5$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 方程好比一架天平：对其中一盘所做的操作，", "必须同样对另一盘进行，天平的平衡——即等式——", "依然保持。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}